## 1. Sidebar Navigation

### Requirement

Add a new sidebar menu item:

**Label:** Commission Report

### Behavior

* On click → open **Commission Report Listing Page**

---

## 2. Commission Report Listing Page

### Layout

Use same layout as existing policy list page:

* Card container
* Table style
* Same spacing, fonts, buttons, colors, and responsiveness

---

### Header Section

At top right:

Button:

> Generate Commission Report

---

### Table Columns

| Column             |
| ------------------ |
| Report Name        |
| Date Range         |
| Created At         |
| Actions (optional) |

---

### Behavior

* Clicking **Generate Commission Report** opens **Generate Report Page**

---

## 3. Generate Commission Report Page

### Title

> Generate Commission Report

Subtitle:

> Create a custom commission report with filters and save it for later reference

---

## 4. Report Configuration Form

### Fields

#### Report Name

Default value:

```
Commission Report 22 Jan 2026
```

Helper text:

> Give your report a descriptive name for easy identification

---

#### Start Date

Date picker
Example: `12/22/2025`

---

#### End Date

Date picker
Example: `01/22/2026`

---

#### Quick Date Range

(Optional dropdown – Today, This Week, This Month, Custom)

---



#### Policy Type (Dropdown)

Options:

* All Types
* Health
* Life
* Motor

Default: All Types



## 5. Buttons

### Preview Button

* Label: `Preview`
* Action: Show report data table below the form

### Save / Generate Button

* Label: `Save Report`
* Saves configuration

---

