## 7. Functional Requirements

### Filtering

Preview table must filter data based on:

* Date range
* Recipient type
* Policy type
* Payment status

---

### Data Source

Use existing:

* Policies
* Customers
* Commissions
* Payout records

No new commission calculation logic needed.

---

